# Git Rules


## Commit Convention

Use Conventional Commits.


Examples:


feat:

fix:

refactor:

docs:

test:

perf:

ci:

style:


==================================================
COMMITS
==================================================

Commits should be:


- Small
- Focused
- Descriptive


Avoid:


Huge commits

Mixed features

Unrelated changes


==================================================
BRANCHES
==================================================

Use:


feature/name

bugfix/name

hotfix/name


==================================================
PULL REQUESTS
==================================================

Every PR should contain:


Description

Changes

Testing

Screenshots (frontend)

Migration notes


==================================================
CODE REVIEW
==================================================

Review:


Architecture

Security

Performance

Tests

Maintainability